usage: python -m owac.raw.n04_mechanism_data [-h] --config CONFIG --output
                                             OUTPUT [--frames FRAMES]
                                             [--batch BATCH]
                                             [--audit-batches AUDIT_BATCHES]
                                             [--remote-evidence REMOTE_EVIDENCE]
                                             [--skip-d0] [--no-write]

N04 S0 D0 analytic 3-D mechanism data and D1 collection feasibility

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       configs/n04/full/s0_data.json
  --output OUTPUT       output directory, for example <run_dir>/mechanism-data
  --frames FRAMES       override D0 frame count
  --batch BATCH         override D0 batch size
  --audit-batches AUDIT_BATCHES
                        comma separated batch sizes
  --remote-evidence REMOTE_EVIDENCE
                        JSON file with observed remote evidence for the D1
                        feasibility report
  --skip-d0             only build D1 outputs
  --no-write            render without writing npz files
